        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo T9175, 1-3/4\" Extended T Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-3/4 inch extended lip T strike plate is for use with any manufacturer's tubular entry locks, passage sets, and privacy sets. It is especially handy for custom installations. The extended strike plate has a 1-3/4 inch lip and a 2-1/4 inch overall length with a 2-3/4 inch width. It comes packaged with mounting hardware. Choose from 4 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in other sizes: <a href=\"/products/2-inch-t-strike-plate-don-jo-t9102\">2\" T Strike Plate</a> and <a href=\"/products/2-1-2-inch-t-strike-plate-don-jo-t9125\">2-1/2\" T Strike Plate</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe satin stainless steel and the dark bronze finishes have a stainless steel base metal. The polished brass and antique brass finishes have a brass base metal.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo T9175 Extended T Door Strike Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Length: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
